          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "The Q3 profit comes from lower recorded costs, not higher sales",
        "text": "Q3 reported a profit of GH¢ 9.21M. This profit was realised because direct cost recorded between June and September reduced from GH¢ 35.30M to GH¢ 31.57M. Upfront business development (BD) costs expensed at the beginning of the year were spread evenly over contract durations, resulting in improvements in the bottom line.",
